      "Max Tenuring Threshold = 15: Limited by the 4-bit age field in the 64-bit object header mark word.",
      "Premature Promotion: If Survivor space overflows, young objects promote directly to Old Gen, causing premature Full GC.",
      "Card Table & Remembered Set: Post-write barriers dirty card bytes whenever Old references Young, preventing full Old Gen scans."
