    "pitfall": "Undersizing Survivor spaces. If short-lived bursty request payloads exceed Survivor capacity, they bypass tenuring thresholds and promote directly to Old Gen ('premature promotion'), accelerating costly Full GCs.",
    "interviewTip": "Explain why the age threshold cannot exceed 15: the Mark Word in the 64-bit HotSpot object header dedicates exactly 4 bits to the object age. The maximum integer representable in 4 bits is 2^4 - 1 = 15."
